{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After surviving a shipwreck on the very edge of the charted seas, you stand before the daunting challenges of mysterious lands waiting to be discovered. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT AND SURVIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896380/extras/8d44be939852bca998995031d3e508cb.poster.avif?t=1772133979\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896380/extras/8d44be939852bca998995031d3e508cb.webm?t=1772133979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896380/extras/8d44be939852bca998995031d3e508cb.mp4?t=1772133979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your own path without the constraints of traditional classes. Level up your skills to unlock new baseline abilities, and search the world for rare spellbooks that grant you extraordinary powers!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GATHER, BUILD AND CRAFT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896380/extras/bd236a001f9788152d94f7c7737e6f05.poster.avif?t=1772133979\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896380/extras/bd236a001f9788152d94f7c7737e6f05.webm?t=1772133979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896380/extras/bd236a001f9788152d94f7c7737e6f05.mp4?t=1772133979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Establish your own base and master a variety of professions to craft and upgrade your armor and weapons. Create potions and enchantments that will be essential for your survival in this unforgiving environment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896380/extras/4f1b8e21895beb86882a8dd6b3676288.poster.avif?t=1772133979\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896380/extras/4f1b8e21895beb86882a8dd6b3676288.webm?t=1772133979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896380/extras/4f1b8e21895beb86882a8dd6b3676288.mp4?t=1772133979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast, procedurally generated world and progress through distinct biomes, each filled with unique enemies, resources, and challenges.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2896380/c12108eda40eed5052a751f24a26f5739cc0ee2c.jpg"},{"name":"Adventurer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2896380/dc34df2e8bdffd08167f263c4453e11af05d3472.jpg"},{"name":"Veteran","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2896380/c286bad43bb818ae8e056a9c4788b338a64d39ac.jpg"},{"name":"I Am the Cook Now","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2896380/96a8aa54593263a192c72f6c209178661a66dd9f.jpg"},{"name":"Mighty Blow","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2896380/1fdeae6cee27c8c6acb583a8311a498592173d04.jpg"},{"name":"Savage Impact","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2896380/33ce1ff54dd893cd2d1ef52cc5a0d2977ec8e290.jpg"},{"name":"Unstoppable Force","path"